<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/29/eng@/~cl_11__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsection: “(4) For the purposes of this section, “net balance due” means— (a) the outstanding amount financed; and (b) terms charges accrued and calculated up to the next due date of payment or the day specified in the notice, whichever is later, less any surrender value of a contract of insurance where— (i) the contract of insurance is taken to cover the amount financed; (ii) the premium for the contract of insurance is paid by the hirer in instalments to the owner; and (iii) the surrender value is received or will be received by the owner upon cancellation of such contract.”. Amendment of section 15"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/29/eng@> .
