<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/29/eng@/~cl_22__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any action, investigation or proceedings for any offence under the principal Act committed before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall, after the date of coming into operation of this Act, be continued as if the principal Act has not been amended by this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/29/eng@> .
