<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/29/eng@/~cl_2__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after the definition of “prescribed” the following definition: ‘ “reference rate” refers to the benchmark interest rate that forms the basis for determining the pricing of variable rate financing facilities, whereby the benchmark rate is the published prevailing overnight policy rate;’; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/29/eng@> .
